# Image and build context for the wish containers.
#
# The build context is the repository root (the Dockerfile installs the pnpm
# workspace), so this file keeps VCS metadata, local installs, build output and
# private runtime state out of the image context. Secrets are never copied into
# the image; `.env*` is excluded outright.

# Version control and editor state
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Local installs and package-manager caches
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm-store
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Build output and test artifacts
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
test-results
**/test-results
playwright-report
**/playwright-report

# Runtime state and uploads are never baked into the image
data
**/data
backups
**/backups

# Secrets and environment files
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets
**/secrets

# Private team control-plane state
.hermes
.omh
approvals
artifacts
TEAM_SETUP.json
TEAM_CAPABILITIES.json

# Docs are not needed to build or run the API
docs
README.md
*.log
.DS_Store
